WEBVTT

00:03:29.334 --> 00:03:31.864
wasafiri wa mda wakishinda
fitina za kihistoria,

00:03:31.864 --> 00:03:33.774
na viumbe tofauti kushabihiana,

00:03:33.774 --> 00:03:38.694
Butler alikuwa na ushawishi wa kushangaza
kwenye umaarufu unaokua wa Afrofuturism.

00:03:38.694 --> 00:03:40.000
Hio ni harakati ya utamaduni

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:44.820
ambapo waandishi na wasanii Weusi ambao
wanavutiwa na ya nyuma, sasa na ya mbele,

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:50.200
kutoa kazi zinazojumuisha mazingaombwe,
historia, teknolojia na mengine mengi.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:53.100
Wakati Lauren anakuja kujifunza kwenye
"Mithali ya Mpanzi,"

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.360
"Kila unachogusa unabadilisha.

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.729
Kila unachobadilisha kinakubadilisha wewe.

00:03:57.729 --> 00:04:01.169
Ukweli pekee usiopinda ni Mabadiliko."